$B'\in \mathcal{B}$ such that
$x\in B'$ and
\begin{equation}\label{eqbesi10}
\int_{B'} u(y)\, d\mu(y)\ge 2\lambda \mu({B'}) \, .
\end{equation}
Define
$u_\lambda(y):=0$ if $|u(y)|<\lambda$ and $u_\lambda(y):=u(y)$ if $|u(y)|\ge \lambda$.
Then with \eqref{eqbesi10}
