\eqref{eqbesi14} and \eqref{eqbesi15} gives
\begin{equation}
    \|M_{\mathcal{B}}u(x)\|_{p_2}^{p_2}
   \le 2^{p_2+2a} (1+(p_2-1)^{-1})\|u\|_{p_2}^{p_2}
